Gar Bear.
我不知道你是怎么做到的
嘎尔熊.

01:08.275 --> 01:12.344
But that's the best cup of
French toast I've ever had.
但这是最好的一杯
我吃过的法式吐司。

01:13.689 --> 01:15.413
Well, time to punch that clock.
好吧，是时候打卡了。

01:15.517 --> 01:16.620
But not before checking
但在检查之前没有

01:16.724 --> 01:19.655
my motivational
quote-a-day calendar.
我的励志
每日报价日历。

01:19.758 --> 01:22.275
"You are a winner."
“你是赢家。”

01:24.689 --> 01:29.517
And today's the first day
of summer.
今天是第一天
夏天的。

01:31.241 --> 01:33.586
Happy first day of summer,
Squidward.
暑假第一天快乐，
章鱼哥。

01:33.689 --> 01:35.758
Care to join me for
solstice caroling?
关心和我一起
至日颂歌？

01:35.862 --> 01:37.620
♪ Walking in the grass,
it's all fine ♪
♪ 漫步在草地上，
一切都好♪

01:37.724 --> 01:41.034
♪ Don't need shoes
in the summertime ♪
♪ 不需要鞋子
夏天的时候♪

01:44.103 --> 01:48.172
I'm not much of a summer person,
SpongeBob.
I'm not much of a summer person,
海绵宝宝。

01:48.275 --> 01:49.724
Davy Jones on the jib!
戴维琼斯在三角帆上！

01:49.827 --> 01:51.241
Do my ears deceive me?
难道是我的耳朵欺骗了我？

01:51.344 --> 01:54.137
Is it really
the first day of summer?
真的是吗
夏天的第一天？

01:54.241 --> 01:55.310
Is it?!
是吗？

01:55.413 --> 01:56.275
Yeah.
是的。

01:56.379 --> 01:59.103
Oo-whee-hoo!
哦呼呼！

01:59.413 --> 02:02.310
Gee, Mr. K,
you sure have
哎呀，K先生，
你肯定有

02:02.413 --> 02:04.241
a scorching case
of summer fever.
灼热的案件
夏季发烧。

02:04.344 --> 02:05.793
What is it about summertime
夏天有什么讲究

02:05.896 --> 02:07.275
that makes us so happy?
这让我们如此高兴？

02:07.379 --> 02:08.551
The firefly-lit nights?
萤火虫点亮的夜晚？

02:08.655 --> 02:11.172
The intoxicating aroma
of a charcoal briquette?
醉人的香气
木炭块？

02:11.275 --> 02:15.241
The hypnotic sound of a lawn
mower running over a flip-flop?
草坪催眠的声音
割草机碾过人字拖？

02:15.344 --> 02:16.931
The money.
钱。

02:17.034 --> 02:18.034
The money?
钱？

02:18.068 --> 02:20.724
Er, uh, I mean, uh...
the children.
呃，呃，我的意思是，呃...
孩子们。

02:20.827 --> 02:21.724
Oh.
哦。

02:21.827 --> 02:22.907
You see, boy, during the summer
你看，孩子，在夏天

02:22.931 --> 02:25.275
the children are excused
from their classes.
孩子们被原谅了
从他们的班级。

02:25.379 --> 02:26.206
A recess commonly
通常有一个休息时间

02:26.310 --> 02:29.655
referred to as summer break.
简称暑假。

02:29.758 --> 02:31.862
Tell me more about summer break.
告诉我更多关于暑假的事情。

02:31.965 --> 02:33.896
Well, during the summer break
嗯，暑假期间

02:34.000 --> 02:37.103
the children wander
Bikini Bottom unsupervised
孩子们徘徊
无人监管的比基尼泳裤

02:37.206 --> 02:39.379
their pockets lined
with allowance
他们的口袋里有衬里
有津贴

02:39.482 --> 02:40.758
free to spend their money
自由地花他们的钱

02:40.862 --> 02:44.241
without any parental guidance
whatsoever.
没有任何家长指导
无论如何。

02:44.344 --> 02:46.310
I guess that's what I like best.
我想这就是我最喜欢的。

02:47.758 --> 02:49.034
Sure I suppose some would try
当然我想有些人会尝试

02:49.137 --> 02:50.965
and take advantage
of this situation
并利用
这种情况的

02:51.068 --> 02:54.068
by selling them toys or candy.
向他们出售玩具或糖果。

02:54.172 --> 02:57.137
But I sleep well at night
with the knowledge
但我晚上睡得很好
与知识

02:57.241 --> 03:00.172
that I'm providing them
with something they need...
我正在向他们提供
和他们需要的东西...

03:00.275 --> 03:02.586
A nutritious meal.
营养丰富的一餐。

03:02.689 --> 03:04.137
Come here, you little piggies!
过来吧，你们这些小猪们！

03:04.241 --> 03:08.137
I've been taught the true
meaning of summer.
我被教导了真实的
夏天的意义。

03:08.827 --> 03:11.965
Almost closing time,
Mr. K.
快到关门时间了，
K 先生

03:12.068 --> 03:12.862
What?!
什么？！

03:12.965 --> 03:14.310
But that's impossible!
但这是不可能的！

03:14.413 --> 03:15.862
What about the money?!
钱呢？！

03:15.965 --> 03:20.517
I mean, uh...
uh, what about the children?
我的意思是，呃...
呃，孩子们呢？

03:21.689 --> 03:23.862
I guess summer isn't
coming this year.
我想夏天不是
今年即将到来。

03:23.965 --> 03:27.310
Hey, maybe they're all
at that new playground
over there.
嘿，也许他们都是
在那个新游乐场
在那儿。

03:27.413 --> 03:28.689
Playground?!
操场？！

03:28.793 --> 03:30.551
Luring away me young customers?
引走我的年轻顾客？

03:30.655 --> 03:34.241
Warm up the boat, SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝，给船预热。

03:36.655 --> 03:39.551
See anything, Mr. Krabs?
看到什么了吗，蟹老板？

03:39.655 --> 03:41.965
Oh, they're here all right.
哦，他们还在这里。

03:42.068 --> 03:43.793
Just look at them, SpongeBob.
看看他们，海绵宝宝。

03:43.896 --> 03:45.620
So weak and malnourished
如此虚弱且营养不良

03:45.724 --> 03:48.517
with nobody trying
to sell them nothing.
没有人尝试
不向他们出售任何东西。

03:48.620 --> 03:49.862
Breaks me heart.
让我心碎。

03:53.586 --> 03:56.000
No!!
不！！

03:56.103 --> 04:00.206
I got nothing to live
for, SpongeBob.
我没有什么可以活的
为了，海绵宝宝。

04:00.310 --> 04:01.758
The way you drove the boat
你驾驶船的方式

04:01.862 --> 04:04.896
belying on the ground
was kind of cool.
躺在地上
有点酷。

04:05.000 --> 04:06.034
True.
真的。

04:06.137 --> 04:07.527
But that's not going
to get these munchkins
但这不会发生
得到这些芒奇金人

04:07.551 --> 04:10.034
away from this playground.
远离这个游乐场。

04:10.137 --> 04:11.586
Unless...
除非...

04:11.689 --> 04:12.862
Hmm.
唔。

04:12.965 --> 04:13.689
See you tomorrow, boy.
明天见，男孩。

04:13.793 --> 04:14.931
Got a lot of work to do.
有很多工作要做。

04:15.034 --> 04:17.068
You got it, Mr. Krabs.
你明白了，蟹老板。

04:17.172 --> 04:18.413
Hey!
嘿！

04:18.517 --> 04:20.034
Another day, another dollar.
又一天，又一美元。

04:20.137 --> 04:21.976
Gee, I wonder what Mr. Krabs has
been up to since I saw him last
哎呀，我想知道蟹老板有什么
自从我上次见到他以来一直在忙

04:22.000 --> 04:24.862
and then went home to do
nothing of particular interest
然后回家做
没有什么特别感兴趣的

04:24.965 --> 04:26.275
till this very moment.
直到这一刻。

04:26.379 --> 04:27.793
Huh?!
啊？！

04:32.793 --> 04:34.000
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

04:34.103 --> 04:37.172
You're just in time for
the grand unveiling of...
你正好赶上
隆重揭幕...

04:37.275 --> 04:38.379
Krabby Land.
克拉比土地。

04:38.482 --> 04:39.655
Krabby Land, sir?
甲米地，先生？

04:39.758 --> 04:41.655
Yes, Krabby Land.
是的，克拉比乐园。

04:41.758 --> 04:44.206
Where a kid can have fun.
孩子们可以玩得开心的地方。

04:44.310 --> 04:45.448
For the right price.
以合适的价格。

04:46.689 --> 04:49.344
Welcome to the Krusty
Krab, young man.
欢迎来到库斯蒂
蟹蟹，年轻人。

04:49.448 --> 04:50.448
What's your name?
你叫什么名字？

04:50.517 --> 04:51.275
Monroe.
门罗。

04:51.379 --> 04:53.000
Nice to meet you, Monroe.
很高兴认识你，门罗。

04:53.103 --> 04:54.517
Whee!
哎哟！

04:56.344 --> 04:57.103
Aha.
啊哈。

04:57.206 --> 04:58.620
Okay, Money...
好吧，钱……

04:58.724 --> 05:00.241
I mean, uh, children.
我的意思是，呃，孩子们。

05:00.344 --> 05:04.344
It's time for the grand
unveiling of Money!
又到了盛大的时候了
金钱揭晓！

05:04.448 --> 05:06.310
I mean, Krabby Land!
我是说，克拉比乐园！

05:06.413 --> 05:07.689
Yay!
耶！

05:07.793 --> 05:09.448
Okay, kids,
now promise Uncle Krabs
好吧，孩子们，
现在向蟹叔叔保证

05:09.551 --> 05:11.620
that if you get hungry
while you're playing
如果你饿了
当你玩的时候

05:11.724 --> 05:13.827
you'll come inside
for some delicious
你会进来的
一些美味的

05:13.931 --> 05:15.931
nutritious Krabby Patties.
营养丰富的蟹黄饼。

05:16.034 --> 05:18.793
We promise.
我们保证。

05:18.896 --> 05:22.517
All right, here we go.
好吧，我们开始吧。

05:22.620 --> 05:26.344
I give you... Krabby Land!
我给你...克拉比土地！

05:26.448 --> 05:28.344
Yay!
耶！

05:40.586 --> 05:42.517
Whoa! Ooh!
哇！哦！

05:42.620 --> 05:43.931
Where am I?
我在哪里？

05:44.034 --> 05:46.000
Uh... that reminds me.
呃……这让我想起了。

05:46.103 --> 05:48.413
I forgot to give you
these coloring books
我忘了给你
这些涂色书

05:48.517 --> 05:50.103
slash liability waivers.
大幅削减责任豁免。

05:50.206 --> 05:51.389
Everyone who hands theirs back
每个归还自己的人

05:51.413 --> 05:55.379
gets to meet the one and only
Krabby the Clown.
遇见唯一的一个
小丑克拉比。

05:55.482 --> 05:56.793
Yay!
Yay!
耶！
耶！

05:56.896 --> 05:58.965
Have fun.
And don't forget to eat plenty
玩得开心。
并且不要忘记多吃

05:59.068 --> 06:00.965
of vitamin-enriched
Krabby Patties...
富含维生素的
蟹黄饼...

06:01.068 --> 06:02.896
Krabby the Clown's
favorite meal.
小丑克拉比的
最喜欢的一餐。

06:03.000 --> 06:06.482
We want Krabby!
We want Krabby!
我们想要蟹蟹！
我们想要蟹蟹！

06:06.586 --> 06:08.344
Where is Krabby,
Mr. Krabs?
克拉比在哪里
蟹老板？

06:08.448 --> 06:11.551
He'll be here after
I count their money.
他稍后会在这里
我数着他们的钱。

06:11.655 --> 06:12.758
Just stall them.
只是拖延他们。

06:12.862 --> 06:14.931
Stall them?
How do I do that?
阻止他们？
我该怎么做？

06:15.034 --> 06:18.379
I don't know, be entertaining.
不知道，娱乐一下吧

06:20.689 --> 06:22.448
Duh-uh... duh.
呃呃……呃。

06:22.551 --> 06:23.551
Hey, kids.
嘿，孩子们。

06:23.620 --> 06:25.517
You're not Krabby the Clown.
你不是小丑克拉比。

06:25.620 --> 06:28.896
No, I'm not. I'm, uh...
不，我不是。我是，呃…

06:29.000 --> 06:31.586
I'm Krabby's beloved sidekick
我是克拉比最亲爱的伙伴

06:31.689 --> 06:36.344
the Krabby Patty... Burglar.
克拉比·帕蒂……窃贼。

06:36.448 --> 06:37.517
Lame.
瘸。

06:37.620 --> 06:38.827
Krabby will be here soon.
克拉比很快就会来。

06:38.931 --> 06:40.724
He, uh, had to take the bus.
他，呃，必须坐公共汽车。

06:40.827 --> 06:44.931
But in the meantime,
let's have some fun!
但与此同时，
让我们玩得开心吧！

06:45.034 --> 06:47.310
You kids like bubbles?
小朋友们喜欢泡泡吗？

06:47.413 --> 06:48.413
No.
不。

06:48.448 --> 06:51.344
Well, you've never
seen my bubbles.
嗯，你从来没有
看到了我的泡泡。

06:53.241 --> 06:54.103
Voila!
瞧！

06:54.206 --> 06:55.655
A bubble shaped
like a jellyfish.
呈气泡状
像水母一样。

06:55.758 --> 06:56.758
How about that?
怎么样？

06:56.862 --> 06:58.931
Still lame.
还是蹩脚。

06:59.586 --> 07:01.068
Okay.
好的。

07:01.172 --> 07:06.000
Prepare to be blown back
on your tail fins.
准备好被吹回来
在你的尾鳍上。

07:07.931 --> 07:11.034
Ta-dah!
哒哒！

07:11.724 --> 07:13.862
Uh. Uh.
呃。呃。

07:13.965 --> 07:15.482
You stink!
你太臭了！

07:15.586 --> 07:17.241
Bring on the clown!
带上小丑吧！

07:17.344 --> 07:17.931
Okay.
好的。

07:18.034 --> 07:20.620
Now for a finale.
现在是结局。

07:21.620 --> 07:24.172
Boo!
Boo!
Boo!
嘘！
嘘！
嘘！

07:24.275 --> 07:25.344
Boo!
嘘！

07:25.448 --> 07:26.793
Boo!
嘘！

07:26.896 --> 07:28.310
Boo!
嘘！

07:28.413 --> 07:29.551
Boo!
嘘！

07:37.758 --> 07:38.758
My eyes!
我的眼睛！

07:40.413 --> 07:42.000
Whoa-oh-oh!
哇哦哦！

07:51.517 --> 07:54.862
They seem to respond
to me being in pain.
他们似乎有回应
对我来说是痛苦的。

07:54.965 --> 07:57.137
They enjoy
other people's misery.
他们享受
别人的痛苦。

07:57.241 --> 08:00.379
Hey, kids.
Check this out.
嘿，孩子们。
看看这个。

08:07.620 --> 08:11.241
I've got them
right where I want them.
我有它们
就在我想要它们的地方。

08:14.344 --> 08:15.448
Aah!
啊啊！

08:57.034 --> 08:59.068
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!
噢！噢！噢！噢！

08:59.172 --> 09:01.862
Ooh! Yow! Ow! Ooh! Yow!
哦！哟！噢！哦！哟！

09:13.413 --> 09:14.551
Mr. Krabs
蟹老板先生

09:14.655 --> 09:17.137
I can't take much more
of this stalling stuff.
我无法承受更多
这些停滞不前的东西。

09:17.241 --> 09:19.862
Always thinking about yourself.
总是为自己着想。

09:19.965 --> 09:21.344
Get out there and stall!
出去并停下来！

09:21.448 --> 09:23.586
What happened to your arms
and legs, boy?
你的手臂怎么了
还有腿，孩子？

09:23.689 --> 09:28.172
The kids are using
them as boomerangs.
孩子们正在使用
他们就像回旋镖。

09:29.793 --> 09:30.793
Boomerangs?
回旋镖？

09:30.862 --> 09:33.586
Oh, no!
They might break my windows.
哦，不！
他们可能会打破我的窗户。

09:33.689 --> 09:34.689
What are we going to do?
我们要做什么？

09:34.758 --> 09:36.318
Well, now that all
their money's counted
好吧，现在这一切
他们的钱被计算在内

09:36.413 --> 09:39.068
tell them Krabby
has just arrived.
告诉他们克拉比
刚刚抵达。

09:39.172 --> 09:41.034
Really? He's here?
真的吗？他来了？

09:41.137 --> 09:43.862
Oh, boy, oh, boy, oh,
boy, oh, boy, oh, boy...
哦，男孩，哦，男孩，哦，
男孩，哦，男孩，哦，男孩……

09:43.965 --> 09:46.620
Get out there and tell them!
出去告诉他们！

09:47.310 --> 09:48.793
Listen, everybody.
听着，大家。

09:48.896 --> 09:52.206
Krabby the Clown
is in the building!
小丑克拉比
就在大楼里！

09:55.103 --> 09:56.758
Who do you want?!
你想要谁？！

09:56.862 --> 09:58.206
Krabby!
蟹蟹！

09:58.310 --> 10:00.517
When do you want him?!
你什么时候要他？！

10:00.620 --> 10:01.758
Now!
现在！

10:01.862 --> 10:03.689
Krabby! Krabby!
蟹蟹！蟹蟹！

10:03.793 --> 10:06.344
Krabby! Krabby! Hooray!
蟹蟹！蟹蟹！万岁！

10:06.448 --> 10:07.448
Hey, kids.
嘿，孩子们。

10:07.551 --> 10:09.931
Are you ready to meet
Krabby the Clown?
你准备好见面了吗
小丑克拉比？

10:10.034 --> 10:11.655
Yay!
耶！

10:11.758 --> 10:13.724
All right. Here you go!
好的。干得好！

10:14.827 --> 10:16.241
Hey, kids.
嘿，孩子们。

10:16.344 --> 10:19.379
Uh, thank you all for coming.
呃，谢谢大家的到来。

10:19.482 --> 10:20.275
Thank you.
谢谢。

10:20.379 --> 10:23.655
Eat plenty of Krabby Patties.
多吃蟹肉饼。

10:26.793 --> 10:28.827
♪ Doo-doo, dee-doodly-doo
♪ 嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟

10:28.931 --> 10:30.724
♪ Doo-doo, dee-doo.
♪ 嘟嘟，嘟嘟。

10:30.827 --> 10:32.793
Ah, Krabs, you'd done it again.
啊，蟹蟹，你又这么做了。

10:32.896 --> 10:34.413
I'll say you have.
我会说你有。

10:34.517 --> 10:35.206
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

10:35.310 --> 10:36.655
How could you, Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板，你怎么能这样呢？

10:36.758 --> 10:40.275
You promised these children
Krabby the Clown.
你答应过这些孩子
小丑克拉比。

10:40.379 --> 10:43.206
But all I saw up there was...
但我在上面看到的只是...

10:43.310 --> 10:45.000
Cheapy the Cheapskate.
便宜的小气鬼。

10:45.103 --> 10:48.034
Hey, I ain't cheap.
嘿嘿，我可不便宜。

10:49.586 --> 10:52.275
Now take this tomato
back to the kitchen
before it spoils.
现在拿这个西红柿
回到厨房
在它变质之前。

10:52.379 --> 10:55.793
But what about
the true meaning of summer?
但是呢
夏天的真正意义？

10:55.896 --> 10:57.551
What about the children?
孩子们呢？

10:57.655 --> 10:58.689
The children?
孩子们？

10:58.793 --> 11:00.275
I don't care about the children.
我不关心孩子们。

11:00.379 --> 11:02.275
I just care about
their parents' money.
我只关心
他们父母的钱。

11:02.379 --> 11:05.689
Ah, the fact that their feeble
minds are easily manipulated
啊，事实上他们的软弱
思想很容易被操纵

11:05.793 --> 11:09.034
by cheap playgrounds
and talentless clowns
便宜的游乐场
和没有才华的小丑

11:09.137 --> 11:10.620
is no skin off my nose.
我的鼻子没有皮肤脱落。

11:10.724 --> 11:13.482
Survival of the fittest,
SpongeBob.
适者生存，
海绵宝宝。

11:13.586 --> 11:16.034
Survival of the fittest.
Heh-heh.
适者生存。
呵呵。

11:19.137 --> 11:20.551
Oh. Hey, kids.
哦。嘿，孩子们。

11:20.655 --> 11:25.724
Uh... Uncle Krabs
has to go to the bank now.
呃……蟹蟹叔叔
现在必须去银行。

11:25.827 --> 11:27.103
Get him!
抓住他！

11:29.827 --> 11:33.586
I suppose I'll never know
the true meaning of summer.
我想我永远不会知道
夏天的真正意义。

11:33.689 --> 11:34.827
I thought I knew it once
我以为我曾经知道过

11:34.931 --> 11:37.793
but that was a long,
long time ago.
但那是一个漫长的、
很久以前。

11:37.896 --> 11:39.137
You mean this morning?
你是说今天早上吗？

11:39.241 --> 11:40.241
Yeah.
是的。

11:41.862 --> 11:44.206
Come outside, Mr. Squarepants.
出来吧，方裤先生。

11:44.310 --> 11:47.655
It's a summer miracle.
这是夏天的奇迹。

11:47.758 --> 11:48.931
Hoorah!
万岁！

11:49.034 --> 11:51.620
Wow, thousands of dollars
fluttering in the breeze.
哇，几千块钱
在微风中飘扬。

11:51.724 --> 11:55.310
I guess that's the true
meaning of summer.
我想这就是事实
夏天的意义。

11:59.310 --> 12:01.172
Where's Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板在哪里？

12:01.275 --> 12:03.965
He's missing out
on all the summer fun.
他错过了
整个夏天的乐趣。

12:04.068 --> 12:05.241
Let me go!
让我走吧！

12:05.344 --> 12:07.758
I got to get some
of that green stuff.
我得买一些
那些绿色的东西。

12:07.862 --> 12:08.862
No!
不！

12:08.931 --> 12:10.931
Not that green stuff!
不是那种绿色的东西！

12:11.034 --> 12:14.482
No!!
不！！

12:27.517 --> 12:30.862
Ah, finally, the weekend is here
啊，终于，周末来了

12:30.965 --> 12:33.241
and this isn't just
any old weekend.
这不仅仅是
任何旧周末。

12:33.344 --> 12:37.827
This is the weekend SpongeBob
and Patrick go camping.
这是海绵宝宝的周末
和帕特里克去露营。

12:37.931 --> 12:41.241
Wouldn't it be great
if they got lost in the woods
这不是很棒吗
如果他们在树林里迷路了

12:41.344 --> 12:42.344
and never came back?
然后再也没有回来？

12:42.413 --> 12:43.862
Patrick, I'm scared.
帕特里克，我很害怕。

12:43.965 --> 12:46.965
Ho-ho, that would be great.
呵呵，那就太好了。

12:47.068 --> 12:49.655
You've waited
a long time for this.
你已经等了
这已经很长时间了。

12:49.758 --> 12:51.206
A soft bed...
柔软的床...

12:51.310 --> 12:52.344
Warm tea...
温茶...

12:52.448 --> 12:53.655
A good book...
一本好书...

12:53.758 --> 12:56.931
And two whole days with no.
整整两天没有。

13:00.827 --> 13:02.172
What the...?
什么……？

13:03.344 --> 13:04.827
SpongeBob... aren't you two
海绵宝宝……你们两个不是吗

13:04.931 --> 13:06.413
supposed to be camping?
应该去露营吗？

13:06.517 --> 13:07.655
We arecamping.
我们正在露营。

13:07.758 --> 13:09.517
SpongeBob, it's not camping
海绵宝宝，这不是露营

13:09.620 --> 13:11.413
if you're ten feet
from your house.
如果你有十英尺
从你家。

13:11.517 --> 13:13.586
It doesn't matter where you are
你在哪里并不重要

13:13.689 --> 13:15.068
as long as you're outdoors.
只要你在户外。

13:15.172 --> 13:18.000
While all those soft city folk
are safe in their beds
虽然所有那些温柔的城里人
在床上很安全

13:18.103 --> 13:20.586
reading books, we're out
here pitting ourselves
看书，我们出去了
这里坑我们自己

13:20.689 --> 13:23.310
against the formidable
forces of nature.
对抗强大的
自然的力量。

13:23.413 --> 13:25.137
You want to join us?
你想加入我们吗？

13:25.241 --> 13:25.862
No.
不。

13:25.965 --> 13:27.586
Okay. Have fun inside.
好的。里面玩得开心。

13:28.793 --> 13:31.413
What do you mean,
have fun inside?
你是什么意思，
里面玩得开心吗？

13:31.517 --> 13:33.241
Just...
have fun inside.
只是...
里面玩得开心。

13:33.344 --> 13:34.517
See you tomorrow.
明天见。

13:34.620 --> 13:37.137
Oh. Bye.
哦。再见。

13:37.413 --> 13:38.241
You little sneak.
你这个小鬼鬼祟祟的。

13:38.344 --> 13:40.068
I see what
you're doing. What?
我明白了什么
你正在做。什么？

13:40.172 --> 13:43.620
Don't think I can't
see what you're doing.
别以为我不能
看看你在做什么。

13:43.724 --> 13:44.620
What?
什么？

13:44.724 --> 13:47.206
You're saying I can't take it.
你说我受不了。

13:47.310 --> 13:48.379
But all I...
但我所有...

13:48.482 --> 13:50.862
You're saying I'm soft.
你说我心软。

13:50.965 --> 13:53.827
You think your little
"have fun inside" challenge
你以为你的小
“在里面玩得开心”挑战

13:53.931 --> 13:56.379
is going to make me
come camping with you
会让我
和你一起露营

13:56.482 --> 13:58.241
but that is
never going to happen.
但那就是
永远不会发生。

13:58.344 --> 14:01.862
There's no way I'm going
to sit out here all night
我没有办法去
坐在这里整晚

14:01.965 --> 14:03.379
with you two losers.
和你们两个失败者在一起。

14:03.482 --> 14:05.310
So get used to it.
所以要习惯它。

14:05.413 --> 14:06.413
Okay.
好的。

14:06.482 --> 14:08.586
Have fun inside.
里面玩得开心。

14:08.689 --> 14:09.931
That's it!
I'm in!
就是这样！
我进来了！

14:10.034 --> 14:11.655
I'll show you camping.
我会带你去露营。

14:11.758 --> 14:15.172
Squidward's going to come
camping with us.
章鱼哥要来了
和我们一起露营。

14:18.586 --> 14:20.448
Now you'll see how a real...
现在你会看到真正的...

14:20.551 --> 14:23.206
outdoorsman does it.
户外人士做到了。

14:23.310 --> 14:26.517
Here we are...
My remote-controlled
我们在这里...
我的遥控

14:26.620 --> 14:28.620
self-assembling tent.
自组装帐篷。

14:28.724 --> 14:31.482
Watch and learn.
观看并学习。

14:36.620 --> 14:38.103
That was great, Squidward
太棒了，章鱼哥

14:38.206 --> 14:39.827
but how do you get inside?
但你怎么进去呢？

14:39.931 --> 14:41.896
Yeah, it's all crushy-looking.
是的，一切都看起来很破碎。

14:42.000 --> 14:45.000
It isn't put up yet, you idiots.
还没放出来呢，你们这些白痴。

14:48.448 --> 14:49.344
Customization.
定制。

14:49.448 --> 14:50.965
Genius.
天才。

14:52.137 --> 14:54.275
He's tenderizing the ground.
他正在使地面变得柔软。

14:54.379 --> 14:55.896
Of course.
当然。

14:58.517 --> 15:00.551
Write that down,
write that down!
写下来，
把它写下来！

15:03.241 --> 15:04.379
Huh?
啊？

15:04.482 --> 15:07.068
Voila.
瞧。

15:09.620 --> 15:15.241
But what could compare to just
lying out under the stars?
但还有什么能比得上
躺在星空下？

15:17.827 --> 15:20.448
Well, Iworked up an appetite
嗯，我食欲大开

15:20.551 --> 15:22.551
as big as all outdoors.
和所有户外的一样大。

15:22.655 --> 15:24.034
Time for a little grub.
是时候吃点东西了。

15:24.137 --> 15:26.517
I suppose you two
are going to stew up
我想你们两个
会炖起来

15:26.620 --> 15:28.137
some twigs and rocks, right?
一些树枝和石头，对吗？

15:28.241 --> 15:31.206
No, we got something
even better...
不，我们有东西
甚至更好...

15:31.310 --> 15:33.379
Marshmallows.
棉花糖。

15:36.482 --> 15:37.275
Mmm-mm.
嗯嗯。

15:37.379 --> 15:38.724
Just like the astronauts eat.
就像宇航员吃东西一样。

15:40.034 --> 15:42.724
Patrick to SpongeBob.
Patrick to SpongeBob.
帕特里克对海绵宝宝。
帕特里克对海绵宝宝。

15:42.827 --> 15:43.965
Do you read me? Over.
你读懂我了吗？超过。

15:44.068 --> 15:46.413
SpongeBob to Patrick.
海绵宝宝对帕特里克。

15:46.517 --> 15:47.586
I read you. Over.
我读懂了你。超过。

15:47.689 --> 15:49.068
Patrick to SpongeBob.
帕特里克对海绵宝宝。

15:49.413 --> 15:51.620
I like going.
我喜欢去。

15:51.724 --> 15:52.965
Over.
超过。

15:53.068 --> 15:54.068
SpongeBob to Patrick.
海绵宝宝对帕特里克。

15:54.103 --> 15:55.241
Me, too.
我也是。

16:01.068 --> 16:05.448
SpongeBob to Patrick,
help yourself. Over.
海绵宝宝对帕特里克，
帮助自己。超过。

16:05.551 --> 16:06.551
Yummy.
好吃。

16:08.034 --> 16:09.620
Patrick to SpongeBob.
帕特里克对海绵宝宝。

16:09.724 --> 16:11.965
The deliciousness has landed.
美味已经落地。

16:12.068 --> 16:15.448
Well, you two astronauts
can eat marshmallows.
好吧，你们两个宇航员
可以吃棉花糖。

16:15.551 --> 16:16.551
I'm going to have a can
我要有一罐

16:16.655 --> 16:19.517
of Swedish barnacle balls...
just as soon
瑞典藤壶球...
尽快

16:19.620 --> 16:21.517
as I can get my can opener.
因为我可以拿到我的开罐器。

16:21.620 --> 16:22.448
But, Squidward
但是，章鱼哥

16:22.551 --> 16:23.671
didn't you take a can opener
你没拿开罐器吗

16:23.724 --> 16:24.793
when you hiked out here?
你什么时候来这里徒步的？

16:24.896 --> 16:25.896
Why would I bother?
我为什么要打扰？

16:25.931 --> 16:27.655
We're ten feet from my house.
我们离我家十英尺。

16:27.758 --> 16:28.965
But this is the wilderness.
但这是荒野。

16:29.068 --> 16:32.379
It just doesn't seem to
fit the camping spirit.
只是似乎没有
符合露营精神。

16:32.482 --> 16:34.620
Pretty weenie.
漂亮的维尼。

16:34.724 --> 16:35.827
All right, all right.
好吧，好吧。

16:35.931 --> 16:37.965
Give me a marshmallow.
给我一块棉花糖。

16:59.827 --> 17:01.206
Ha-ha-ha.
哈哈哈。

17:01.310 --> 17:02.413
Ha-ha-ha.
哈哈哈。

17:02.517 --> 17:06.241
Okay, besides spitting
molten foodstuffs at me
好吧，除了吐口水
融化的食物在我身上

17:06.344 --> 17:08.862
what else do you do for fun?
你还做什么好玩的事？

17:08.965 --> 17:11.551
Well... after a long day
of camping
好吧...经过漫长的一天
露营的

17:11.655 --> 17:16.482
it's nice to unwind with
a nice, relaxing campfire song.
很高兴与您一起放松
一首优美、轻松的篝火歌曲。

17:16.586 --> 17:20.034
I call this one
"The Campfire Song Song."
我称这个为
《篝火歌》。

17:20.137 --> 17:22.758
♪ Let's gather round
the campfire ♪
♪ 让我们围成一圈
篝火♪

17:22.862 --> 17:24.827
♪ And sing our
campfire song ♪
♪ 唱我们的
篝火歌♪

17:24.931 --> 17:29.551
♪ Our C-A-M-P-F-I-R-E
S-O-N-G song ♪
♪ 我们的 C-A-M-P-F-I-R-E
S-O-N-G 歌曲 ♪

17:29.655 --> 17:32.758
♪ And if you don't think
that we can sing it ♪
♪ 如果你不这么认为
我们可以唱它♪

17:32.862 --> 17:34.517
♪ Faster, then you're wrong
♪ 更快，那你就错了

17:34.620 --> 17:38.586
♪ But it'll help
if you just sing along... ♪
♪ 但这会有帮助
如果你只是跟着唱...♪

17:38.689 --> 17:41.724
♪ Bom, bom, bom
♪ 嘭，嘭，嘭

17:41.827 --> 17:44.413
♪ C-A-M-P-F-I-R-E
S-O-N-G song ♪
♪ C-A-M-P-F-I-R-E
S-O-N-G 歌曲 ♪

17:44.517 --> 17:47.034
♪ C-A-M-P-F-I-R-E
S-O-N-G song ♪
♪ C-A-M-P-F-I-R-E
S-O-N-G 歌曲 ♪

17:47.137 --> 17:48.320
♪ And if you don't
think that we ♪
♪ 如果你不这样做
认为我们♪

17:48.344 --> 17:49.596
♪ Can sing it faster,
then you are wrong ♪
♪ 唱得更快，
那你就错了♪

17:49.620 --> 17:51.965
♪ But it'll help
if you just sing along... ♪
♪ 但这会有帮助
如果你只是跟着唱...♪

17:52.068 --> 17:55.620
♪ C-A-M-P-F-I-R-E
S-O-N-G song ♪ Patrick!
♪ C-A-M-P-F-I-R-E
S-O-N-G 歌曲 ♪ 帕特里克！

17:55.724 --> 17:57.517
♪ Song. C-A-M-P-F-I-R-E...
♪ 歌曲。营火...

17:57.620 --> 17:59.172
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

17:59.275 --> 17:59.827
Good.
好的。

17:59.931 --> 18:02.655
♪ It'll help...
♪ 这会有所帮助...

18:02.758 --> 18:04.103
♪ It'll help...
♪ 这会有所帮助...

18:04.206 --> 18:09.068
♪ If you just sing along...
♪ 只要你跟着唱...

18:11.482 --> 18:13.000
♪ Oh, yeah!
♪ 哦，是的！

18:14.206 --> 18:16.862
Now, wasn't that relaxing?
现在，这不是很放松吗？

18:16.965 --> 18:17.620
No.
不。

18:17.724 --> 18:19.586
Thisis relaxing.
这很放松。

18:23.758 --> 18:24.758
Oh, no!
哦，不！

18:24.793 --> 18:28.000
I'll save you, Squidward.
我会救你的，章鱼哥。

18:31.724 --> 18:33.379
Squidward, are you all right?
章鱼哥，你还好吗？

18:33.482 --> 18:34.310
That's it.
就是这样。

18:34.413 --> 18:36.655
Chew... chew...
and swallow.
嚼……嚼……
并吞下。

18:38.172 --> 18:39.827
There. Better?
那里。更好的？

18:39.931 --> 18:40.793
Better?!
更好的？！

18:40.896 --> 18:42.379
I was just fine
until you launched
我很好
直到你启动

18:42.482 --> 18:44.724
that ballistic junk food
into my windpipe!
弹道垃圾食品
进入我的气管！

18:44.827 --> 18:46.172
But I had to. It's
too dangerous
但我不得不这么做。这是
太危险了

18:46.275 --> 18:49.896
to play the clarinet badly
out here in the wilderness.
单簧管吹得不好
在这荒野里。

18:50.000 --> 18:52.620
It might attract...
可能会吸引...

18:52.724 --> 18:54.344
a sea bear.
一只海熊。

18:54.448 --> 18:55.551
A sea bear?
海熊？

18:55.655 --> 18:58.896
You mean like the ones
that... don't exist?!
你的意思是像那些
那……不存在？！

18:59.000 --> 19:00.827
What are you saying?
你在说什么？

19:00.931 --> 19:02.620
There's no such thing.
没有这样的事。

19:02.724 --> 19:03.896
They're just a myth.
它们只是一个神话。

19:04.000 --> 19:05.000
Oh, no, Squidward.
哦，不，章鱼哥。

19:05.103 --> 19:06.517
Sea bears are all too real.
海熊太真实了。

19:06.620 --> 19:09.724
It says so in the
Bikini Bottom Inquirer.
它是这样说的
比基尼泳裤询问者。

19:09.827 --> 19:11.068
"I married a Sea Bear"?
“我嫁给了一只海熊”？

19:11.172 --> 19:13.413
Yeah, and Fake Science Monthly.
是的，还有《假科学月刊》。

19:13.517 --> 19:16.344
"Sea Bears and
Fairytales Are Real"?
“海熊和
童话是真的吗”

19:16.448 --> 19:20.172
That's the stupidest thing
I've ever heard.
这是最愚蠢的事
我曾经听说过。

19:20.275 --> 19:22.310
Well, maybe it isstupid
好吧，也许这很愚蠢

19:22.413 --> 19:23.793
but it's also dumb.
但这也是愚蠢的。

19:23.896 --> 19:24.976
Patrick's right, Squidward...
帕特里克是对的，章鱼哥……

19:25.000 --> 19:26.344
Sea Bears are
no laughing matter.
海熊是
没什么好笑的。

19:26.448 --> 19:28.310
Why, once I met this guy
who knew this guy
为什么，一旦我遇到这个人
谁认识这个人

19:28.413 --> 19:29.862
who knew this guy
who knew this guy
谁认识这个人
谁认识这个人

19:29.965 --> 19:31.793
who knew this guy
who knew this guy
谁认识这个人
谁认识这个人

