谁认识这个人

19:36.034 --> 19:37.586
who knew this guy
who knew this guy
谁认识这个人
谁认识这个人

19:37.689 --> 19:39.310
who knew this guy
who knew this guy
谁认识这个人
谁认识这个人

19:39.413 --> 19:40.862
who knew this guy's cousin...
谁认识这个人的表弟...

19:40.965 --> 19:41.965
You're right!
你说得对！

19:42.068 --> 19:43.724
I should be more careful.
我应该更加小心。

19:43.827 --> 19:45.482
In fact, why don't you tell me
事实上，你为什么不告诉我

19:45.586 --> 19:47.586
all of the things I shouldn't do
所有我不应该做的事情

19:47.689 --> 19:50.517
if I want to keep
the sea bears away.
如果我想保留
大海远去。

19:50.620 --> 19:51.517
Okay, that's easy.
好吧，这很容易。

19:51.620 --> 19:53.724
First off,
don't play the clarinet.
首先，
不要吹单簧管。

19:53.827 --> 19:55.137
Okay, then what?
好吧，然后呢？

19:55.241 --> 19:56.976
Never wave your flashlight
back and forth really fast.
切勿挥动手电筒
来回真的很快。

19:57.000 --> 19:59.172
Flashlights are
their natural prey.
手电筒是
他们的天然猎物。

19:59.275 --> 20:00.103
You're kidding.
你开玩笑吧。

20:00.206 --> 20:01.758
Don't stomp around...
They take that
别乱踩...
他们认为

20:01.862 --> 20:02.896
as a challenge.
Yeah.
作为一个挑战。
是的。

20:03.000 --> 20:03.689
Go on.
继续。

20:03.793 --> 20:05.137
Don't ever eat cheese.
永远不要吃奶酪。

20:05.241 --> 20:06.241
Sliced or cubed?
切片还是切块？

20:07.965 --> 20:09.137
Cubed. Sliced is fine.
立方体。切片就好了

20:09.241 --> 20:10.344
Yeah, yeah. And?
是啊是啊。和？

20:10.448 --> 20:12.620
Never wear a sombrero......in
a goofy fashion.
永远不要戴宽边帽......
一种愚蠢的时尚。

20:12.724 --> 20:14.689
Or clown shoes.
Or a hoop
skirt.
或者小丑鞋。
或者一个铁环
裙子。

20:14.793 --> 20:16.655
And never...
Ever...
并且从来没有...
曾经...

20:16.758 --> 20:17.827
Ever!
Duh!
曾经！
呃！

20:17.931 --> 20:20.172
Screech like a chimpanzee!
像黑猩猩一样尖叫！

20:20.275 --> 20:21.275
Wow. It's amazing
哇。太神奇了

20:21.310 --> 20:24.517
how many things
can set a sea bear off.
有多少东西
可以引爆海熊。

20:24.620 --> 20:25.827
They're horrible.
他们太可怕了。

20:25.931 --> 20:29.517
And... and suddenly,
I have the sense
然后……突然间，
我有感觉

20:29.620 --> 20:31.689
we're all in danger.
我们都处于危险之中。

20:31.793 --> 20:32.931
Why?
Why?
为什么？
为什么？

20:33.034 --> 20:35.448
I don't know...
我不知道...

20:35.551 --> 20:37.793
Just a feeling!
只是一种感觉！

20:37.896 --> 20:38.758
No.
不。

20:38.862 --> 20:39.862
Yes.
是的。

20:39.896 --> 20:40.896
No.
不。

20:41.965 --> 20:43.551
Squidward, please don't.
章鱼哥，请别这样。

20:47.551 --> 20:49.586
SpongeBob, what are
we going to do?
海绵宝宝，什么是
我们要做什么？

20:49.689 --> 20:52.241
A sea bear is sure
to come and eat us.
海熊是肯定的
来吃我们。

20:52.344 --> 20:53.517
Don't worry, Patrick.
别担心，帕特里克。

20:53.620 --> 20:56.137
I'll draw us an anti-sea bear
circle in the dirt.
我会画一只反海熊
在泥土中画圈。

20:56.241 --> 20:57.034
Good thinking.
好想法。

20:57.137 --> 20:58.275
All the experts say
所有专家都说

20:58.379 --> 21:00.551
it's the only defense
against a sea bear attack.
这是唯一的防御
抵御海熊的攻击。

21:00.655 --> 21:04.310
Ha-ha-ha-ha. You guys
are so gullible.
哈哈哈。你们
太容易受骗了。

21:04.413 --> 21:09.310
See? I did everything
that attracts a sea bear
看？我做了一切
吸引海熊的

21:09.413 --> 21:11.137
and nothing happened.
但什么也没发生。

21:11.241 --> 21:14.482
If sea bears really exist,
why didn't one show up?
如果海熊真的存在
为什么没有人出现？

21:14.586 --> 21:16.413
Maybe it's because
you're not wearing
也许是因为
你没穿

21:16.517 --> 21:18.586
your sombrero
in a goofy fashion.
你的宽边帽
以一种愚蠢的方式。

21:18.689 --> 21:20.034
Oh, pfft. Sorry.
哦，噗。对不起。

21:20.137 --> 21:21.758
How silly of me.
我真傻。

21:21.862 --> 21:23.689
You mean like this?
你的意思是这样吗？

21:28.172 --> 21:29.172
No. Like that.
不，就像这样。

21:42.862 --> 21:45.586
Squidward, are you okay?
章鱼哥，你还好吗？

21:45.689 --> 21:46.758
No.
不。

21:46.862 --> 21:49.896
Quick. Jump inside our
anti-sea bear circle
快的。跳进我们的
防海熊圈

21:50.000 --> 21:51.172
before he comes back.
在他回来之前。

21:51.275 --> 21:54.724
Yeah. Sea bears
often attack
more than once.
是的。海熊
经常攻击
不止一次。

21:54.827 --> 21:55.827
Are you crazy?
你疯了？

21:55.862 --> 21:59.206
A dirt circle won't
stop that monster.
污垢圈不会
阻止那个怪物。

21:59.310 --> 22:01.379
I'm running for my life.
我正在为我的生命而奔跑。

22:01.482 --> 22:02.482
No!
不！

22:07.275 --> 22:10.793
Don't run! Sea
bears hate that.
别跑！海
熊讨厌这样。

22:11.517 --> 22:12.620
Thanks for the tip.
谢谢你的提示。

22:12.724 --> 22:16.103
I guess I'll just
limp home, then.
我想我只会
那么，跛行回家吧。

22:16.206 --> 22:17.206
No!
不！

22:24.103 --> 22:27.068
They hate limping
more than running!
他们讨厌跛行
比跑步更重要！

22:27.172 --> 22:30.034
Well, I guess I'll just have...
好吧，我想我只会...

22:32.724 --> 22:37.137
I should have warned you
about crawling.
我应该警告你的
关于爬行。

22:40.862 --> 22:42.965
What did I do that time?
我当时做了什么？

22:43.068 --> 22:47.034
I don't know. I guess
he just doesn't like you.
我不知道。我猜
他只是不喜欢你。

22:47.137 --> 22:49.000
Pretend to be somebody else.
假装成别人。

22:49.103 --> 22:50.827
Here, draw a circle.
在这里，画一个圆圈。

22:50.931 --> 22:52.896
Okay.
好的。

22:58.172 --> 22:59.862
That was an oval!
那是一个椭圆形！

22:59.965 --> 23:02.689
It has to be a circle!
一定是一个圆！

23:02.793 --> 23:03.793
Move over!
移过去！

23:14.965 --> 23:16.965
Hey. It worked.
嘿。它起作用了。

23:17.068 --> 23:19.275
You guys saved my life.
你们救了我的命。

23:21.275 --> 23:23.758
Yeah. I'm glad it was
just a sea bear.
是的。我很高兴这是
只是一只海熊。

23:23.862 --> 23:27.931
This circle would never
hold back a sea rhinoceros.
这个圈子永远不会
挡住海犀。

23:28.034 --> 23:29.379
What attracts them?
是什么吸引他们？

23:29.482 --> 23:32.068
The sound of a sea bear attack.
海熊攻击的声音。

23:33.172 --> 23:34.586
Huh. Good thing
we're all wearing
呵呵。好东西
我们都穿着

23:34.689 --> 23:37.310
our anti-sea
rhinoceros
undergarments.
我们的反海
犀牛
内衣。

23:37.413 --> 23:38.793
Right, Squidward?
对吧，章鱼哥？

23:38.896 --> 23:39.896
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

